  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The work to be done&nbsp;in the process is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>d</mi><mi>W</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pa</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>671</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>001</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>670</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The change in heat energy during the vaporisation process can be calculated as follows-</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#916;</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>supplied&#160;</mtext></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2257</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>22</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Hence, the change in internal energy in the process is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>U</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>&#916;</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>supplied</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>W</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>(</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>67</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>20</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2090</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
